{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48976","headline":"道傍松 · 熊皎","name":"道傍松","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偃盖当衢莫记年，独含苍翠鹤应怜。\n垂阴独向笙歌地，有韵自成风雨天。\n尘□路岐分夜月，烧侵根脚起残烟。\n论功只合行人赏，销得烦蒸古道边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}